    "answer": {
      "short": "$xy=1$.\n\nSubstitute $b=a^x$ into $b^y=a$ to obtain $a^{xy}=a^1$, then equate powers.",
      "worked": "Substitute $b=a^x$ into $b^y=a$:\n$$\\begin{align*}(a^x)^y&=a\\\\a^{xy}&=a^1\\end{align*}$$\nSince $a>0$ and $a\\ne1$, equal powers of $a$ have equal exponents. Hence $xy=1$.",
